      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "\"Sorry to hear that our breakfast service didn't meet your expectations today. We're taking all feedback seriously and will review our buffet replenishment times to ensure that our guests have a more satisfying experience. We appreciate your feedback and would like to invite you to contact us directly so we can make things right. We're committed to providing the best possible service and value for our guests.\"\n\nThis response acknowledges the guest's disappointment, shows that you're taking their feedback seriously, and offers a solution (inviting them to contact you directly). It's sincere, grounded, and doesn't try to sugarcoat the issue. The tone is professional and apologetic, which should help to diffuse the situation and show that you're committed to making things right.",
